{"nodes": [{"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_scm_gpu_backends", "label": "SCM GPU backends", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two optional HIP backends move the per-node-independent stages of an SCM step (ray casting and the dense Bekker/Mohr-Coulomb/Janosi force loop) onto the GPU; contact-patch clustering and bulldozing stay on the CPU because they are not per-node independent."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_computeinternalforces", "label": "SCMLoader::ComputeInternalForces", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_eligibility_fallback", "label": "GPU eligibility checks and CPU fallback", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Force GPU needs uniform soil (no RegisterSoilParametersCallback), rigid ChBody contactables and at least min_hits (8192) hits; ray-cast GPU needs registered active domains with triangle-mesh collision shapes, the only type the kernels intersect. Primitive or convex-hull models stay on the CPU path and report once on stderr instead of silently returning no hits."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_config", "label": "scm_gpu::Config settings", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "enabled, min_hits (8192), reserve_hits (65536), async HIP streams for pack/compute/scatter, and profile timings to stderr."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_fp32_determinism", "label": "FP32 kernels for cross-vendor determinism", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ray-cast kernels run FP32 on every platform so a model traces the same trajectory on AMD and NVIDIA rather than diverging by vendor; FP64 is reachable via SCM_RAYCAST_GPU_PRECISION for validation only."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_hip_on_nvidia", "label": "HIP on NVIDIA default", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The kernels exist only in HIP and compile through HIP's NVIDIA platform with nvcc, so 'is HIP available' and 'can this use the GPU' are the same question - hence CHRONO_ENABLE_HIP_ON_NVIDIA defaults ON, while Chrono::DEM and FSI::SPH still resolve to CUDA on NVIDIA."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_validation_offset", "label": "Systematic sinkage offset vs the Bullet CPU path", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "On demo_ROBOT_Viper_SCM the wheel sinks ~5.5 cm on the GPU ray-cast backend versus ~4.3 cm through Bullet, consistently across resolutions and vendors. EnableRaycastGpuReference (same algorithm on CPU) agrees within 0.09%, so the gap is formulation, not hardware: ~2% from the force backend, millimeters from collision margin, micrometers from kernel precision."}], "edges": [{"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_scm_gpu_backends", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_computeinternalforces", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_scm_gpu_backends", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_eligibility_fallback", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_scm_gpu_backends", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_config", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_scm_gpu_backends", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_fp32_determinism", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_scm_gpu_backends", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_hip_on_nvidia", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_scm_gpu_backends", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_validation_offset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_scm_gpu_backends", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scmterrain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_eligibility_fallback", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_soilparameterscallback", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_computeinternalforces", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_bekker_wong", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_vehicle_vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu_fp32_determinism", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_sensor_sensor_overview_reproducible_stochastic_sensors", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/vehicle/vehicle_terrain_scm_gpu.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_doc